OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G1/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 urges government to     
OL,4,Cconfirm 2034 Freeview switch-off       
OL,6,FChannel 4 has called on the government 
OL,7,Fto commit to switching off digital     
OL,8,Fterrestrial television (DTT), the      
OL,9,Faerial-delivered signal behind         
OL,10,FFreeview, in 2034.                     
OL,12,FIn a statement titled Securing a       
OL,13,FSustainable Future for TV Distribution,
OL,14,Fwhich summarises its response to the   
OL,15,Fgovernment's Media Green Paper, Channel
OL,16,F4 says it is "united with" the other   
OL,17,Fpublic service broadcasters (the BBC,  
OL,18,FITV, 5, STV and S4C) in backing a      
OL,19,Fmanaged move to internet-only (IPTV) TV
OL,20,Fin 2034.                               
OL,23,EPub: 17-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14302
SC,0002
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 urges government to     
OL,4,Cconfirm 2034 Freeview switch-off       
OL,6,FThe broadcaster argues that delaying   
OL,7,Fswitch-off to 2044 would leave viewers 
OL,8,Fwho rely on an aerial with a "dwindling
OL,9,Frange of channels and content", as     
OL,10,Fcommercial channels leave the platform 
OL,11,Fand costs rise for those who remain.   
OL,13,FIt estimates its own per-household cost
OL,14,Fof DTT will rise fourfold between 2024 
OL,15,Fand 2034, diverting money from British 
OL,16,Fcontent and services.                  
OL,18,FIt also says keeping DTT going for     
OL,19,Fanother decade would need a substantial
OL,20,Frebuild of the network, at an estimated
OL,21,Fcost to broadcasters of #1.5bn.        
OL,23,EPub: 17-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14303
SC,0003
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 urges government to     
OL,4,Cconfirm 2034 Freeview switch-off       
OL,6,FChannel 4 says a 2034 switchover is    
OL,7,Fachievable. Citing the latest          
OL,8,Fforecasts, it says just 0.67 million   
OL,9,Fhouseholds, around 2%, will be without 
OL,10,FIPTV by 2034, and that targeted support
OL,11,Ffor vulnerable and unconnected homes   
OL,12,Fcould close that gap.                  
OL,14,FIt says this could be funded through   
OL,15,Fthe "millions" a full transition would 
OL,16,Funlock, including proceeds from a      
OL,17,Ffuture auction of the DTT spectrum.    
OL,23,EPub: 17-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14304
SC,0004
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 urges government to     
OL,4,Cconfirm 2034 Freeview switch-off       
OL,6,FThe paper argues the benefits would go 
OL,7,Fbeyond TV. It says households that     
OL,8,Fremain offline pay around 25% more each
OL,9,Fyear for goods and services, and that a
OL,10,Ffully digital society could add up to  
OL,11,F#31bn a year to the UK economy.        
OL,13,FIt points to the government's target of
OL,14,Fgigabit-capable broadband reaching 99% 
OL,15,Fof premises by 2032.                   
OL,17,FOn security, it argues that DTT's      
OL,18,Freliance on a small number of major    
OL,19,Ftransmitter sites makes it more        
OL,20,Fvulnerable to threats such as physical 
OL,21,Fsabotage than broadband's distributed  
OL,22,Fnetwork.                               
OL,23,EPub: 17-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14305
SC,0005
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 urges government to     
OL,4,Cconfirm 2034 Freeview switch-off       
OL,6,FThe paper calls on the government to   
OL,7,Fmove from recognising the case for     
OL,8,Fchange to setting out "the clear       
OL,9,Ftimetable and coordinated framework"   
OL,10,Fneeded to deliver switch-off in 2034.  
OL,12,FIt also says public service            
OL,13,Fbroadcasters must keep prominence and  
OL,14,F"fair commercial terms" on the global  
OL,15,Fplatforms that increasingly sit between
OL,16,Fthem and viewers.                      
OL,18,FMedia analyst Ian Whittaker, whose     
OL,19,Freport A Risk Too Far was commissioned 
OL,20,Fby transmitter operator Arqiva, has    
OL,21,Fpublished a critique of the statement  
OL,22,Fon LinkedIn.                           
OL,23,EPub: 17-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14306
SC,0006
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 urges government to     
OL,4,Cconfirm 2034 Freeview switch-off       
OL,6,FHe accepts some of its arguments,      
OL,7,Fsaying the point that commercial       
OL,8,Fchannels would leave Freeview as       
OL,9,Faudiences shrank, if switch-off slipped
OL,10,Fto 2044, raises questions over a delay.
OL,12,FBut he says the statement treats       
OL,13,Fswitch-off as a simple change of       
OL,14,Fdistribution method, with "no mention  
OL,15,Fof the impact on advertising revenues".
OL,17,FHis report argued that commercial      
OL,18,Fpublic service broadcasters' ad revenue
OL,19,Fwould be 16% lower in 2034 under a 2034
OL,20,Fswitch-off than under the 2044 path.   
OL,23,EPub: 17-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14307
SC,0007
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 urges government to     
OL,4,Cconfirm 2034 Freeview switch-off       
OL,6,FHe also questions the household        
OL,7,Ffigures.                               
OL,9,FHe points out that the government's own
OL,10,Fgreen paper forecasts 1.51 million     
OL,11,Fhomes still watching only through an   
OL,12,Faerial in 2034, more than twice the    
OL,13,Fstatement's figure. He says the gap is 
OL,14,Fthe older households who rely on       
OL,15,FFreeview in the North of England,      
OL,16,FWales, Scotland and Northern Ireland.  
OL,23,EPub: 17-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14308
SC,0008
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G8/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 urges government to     
OL,4,Cconfirm 2034 Freeview switch-off       
OL,6,FWhittaker adds that spectrum auction   
OL,7,Fmoney goes to the Treasury, so funding 
OL,8,Fthe transition that way would depend on
OL,9,Fthe Chancellor of the day. On security,
OL,10,Fhe argues the value of a broadcast     
OL,11,Fnetwork is that it fails differently   
OL,12,Ffrom the internet, so a single event   
OL,13,Fcannot take out both.                  
OL,15,FHis central question is whether        
OL,16,Fbroadcasters should give up their one  
OL,17,Findependent route to viewers before    
OL,18,Fsecuring proper terms for reaching them
OL,19,Fonline.                                
OL,23,EPub: 17-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14309
SC,0009
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G9/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 urges government to     
OL,4,Cconfirm 2034 Freeview switch-off       
OL,6,FThe government's green paper, Watch    
OL,7,Fthis Space, published in June, set out 
OL,8,Ftwo options. The first was an          
OL,9,Findustry-led switch-off in 2034,       
OL,10,Ffreeing up spectrum from 2035. The     
OL,11,Fsecond was an extension to 2044, with  
OL,12,Fthe platform cut from six multiplexes  
OL,13,Fto three to reduce costs.              
OL,23,EPub: 17-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,144,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14310
SC,0010
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Fri 20 NovC07:42/04
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G10/10
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 urges government to     
OL,4,Cconfirm 2034 Freeview switch-off       
OL,6,FThe government said it saw a           
OL,7,F"compelling case" for 2034, but warned 
OL,8,Fthat no assumption should be made that 
OL,9,Fpublic funding would be available for  
OL,10,Fthe transition. It said a final        
OL,11,Fdecision would be set out in a white   
OL,12,Fpaper. In September, Arqiva wrote to   
OL,13,Fthe government urging a 2044 date      
OL,14,Finstead.                               
OL,23,EPub: 17-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
